=3 Notes
* Marids spawn a single {m:Chigoe} when they use a TP move.
* Mamool Ja can be avoided with {p:Invisible (Status)}.

=2 Walkthrough
You complete this Assault by killing or subduing all 8 Marids. You will get more Assault Points for subduing the 8 Marids without killing them. In order to subdue a Marid, use the Temporary Item {i:Thunderguard Dart|Thunderguard Dart|5442} on the marid. If successful, the marid will despawn and you will be credited with capturing it.
* {i:Thunderguard Darts|Thunderguard Dart|5442} can be obtained by talking to the starting NPC, {n:Zimahd}. Despite how rare and expensive he claims them to be, he has an infinite supply of darts.
* Each person can only carry one dart at a time.
* The best time to use a dart on a Marid is when the Marid has 0 TP (right after a weaponskill) and low HP (below 50%). When timed properly, successful capture is virtually guaranteed.

To unlock the {p:Rune of Release} at the southwest of (I-9), capture or kill all 8 marids.
* 1333 base points will be awarded for capturing all 8 marids.
** 2198 points awarded for capturing all 8 marids solo (with assault band bonus, of course)
* 266 base points will be awarded for killing all 8 marids.

